<h2>Procurement readiness starts before the proposal is written</h2><p>A useful software procurement response must connect the buyer’s instructions, requirements, evaluation method and contract conditions to a traceable technical and commercial offer. Fida Technologies can review an expression of interest, request for information, RFQ, RFP, terms of reference or tender document and prepare a response for the requirements it can responsibly meet.</p><p>The issuing organization remains responsible for its procurement method, timetable, clarifications and evaluation. Fida does not claim eligibility, certification, experience or compliance until the relevant evidence and current tender conditions have been checked.</p>
